# Migration exports, dumps and archives under any name (repo root: the Hugo tree never holds these).
# .gitignore only prevents commits; keep raw exports outside the repo (see docs/privacy.md).
/*.xml
*.sql.*
*.dump
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.7z
*.bz2
*.xz
# local review notes
/comments.md
/.local-backups/

